<section class="section">
  <h2 class="section__title" id="about"><span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span> about<a class="anchor" href="#about" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>
  <p>
    I am interested in the systems between writing code and safely shipping it. I like
    making large codebases feel fast, understandable, and easy to change.
  </p>
  <p>
    At Stripe, I lead Code Forge and Code Review. We build source control infrastructure
    for Stripe's massive, fast-moving Git monorepo and improve the code review process,
    including an AI reviewer designed to catch problems before production and eventually
    approve lower-risk changes. Before Stripe, I was at GitHub.
  </p>
  <p class="muted">
    Technical interests: version control systems, blob-storage-backed database design,
    agent harness development, and developer productivity.
  </p>
  <p class="muted">
    Otherwise: pickleball, strategy games like Magic: The Gathering and Twilight Imperium,
    exploring cities near and far, and going max effort at karaoke.
  </p>
</section>

